DATA ATTRIBUTION

This project uses data from the following sources:

1. NOAA VIIRS Active Fires (FDCF)
   - Source: NOAA/NASA Suomi NPP VIIRS
   - License: Public Domain
   - Access: https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/

2. ERA5 Reanalysis
   - Source: Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S)
   - License: https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/api/v2/terms/static/licence-to-use-copernicus-products.pdf
   - Citation: Hersbach et al. (2020)

3. PRISM Climate Data (if used)
   - Source: PRISM Climate Group, Oregon State University
   - License: https://prism.oregonstate.edu/terms/
   - Restrictions: Academic and research use

Please ensure compliance with the respective data licenses when using this software.
